{"candidate_identity":"bc4315060ec6033a5c0b9bb20af88592adba39832928bb706b059eefa0623dfa","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"487c956fb3f3f296b34c5949f21cdc2ab01edca18cc93ad4de23cd06b1359588","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c7af1f5130a3d655dbb9c77db0dc77b3c878563af580d33352659021e57a0bf8","logical_entry_identity":"ef4d274fe789fcdc9c04fd7ab389a196e71e675caaaa30c1a3335696ac9d73d3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Turns the golem's skin into molten rock. The heat generated sets ablaze everything inside a radius of 3, doing %0.2f fire damage in 3 turns for %d turns.\n\t\tBurning is cumulative; the longer they stay within range, they higher the fire damage they take.\n\t\tIn addition the golem gains %d%% fire resistance.\n\t\tMolten Skin damage will not affect friendly creatures.\n\t\tThe damage and resistance will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使傀儡的皮肤化为熔岩。产生的高温会点燃半径 3 格内的一切，使其在 3 回合内受到 %0.2f 点火焰伤害；炽热皮肤持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t灼烧可以叠加；目标处于范围内越久，受到的火焰伤害越高。\n\t\t此外，傀儡获得 %d%% 火焰抗性。\n\t\t召唤者存活时，炽热皮肤只会伤害召唤者的敌人。\n\t\t伤害和抗性随你的法术强度提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"15831dcf8d50b5580ed679e69f744da5561d06186a1d162f0f90ec5151f9bf91","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c7b26a3162b0b2882acfb2d8fa274fa7381e2157893ac3b35abcbb4c9cfb175a","logical_entry_identity":"17b8d4fd26e73217d62edb4bbeb770d840ae3a871de44c15867ab35c45a7a771","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"humming mindstar","source_tag":"_t","target":"吟唱的灵晶"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"33826e141abb98f72bc531c02a2c2d7a778344a7a1fd56b199cca22243356899","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c7b42ca8c006fb3a076b3530c090c4319a3bc9cfb38361529af53747e525a9ef","logical_entry_identity":"5e6290768e830d70cd164070bfcb8cdaf297482aa65f32bb8e7467771c694243","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Generate an electrical field around you in a radius of %d. Any creature caught inside will lose up to %0.1f%% of its current life (%0.1f%% if the target is Elite or Rare, %0.1f%% if the target is a Unique or Boss, and %0.1f%% if they are an Elite Boss.). This life drain is irresistable, but can be saved against with physical save.\n\t\tAdditionally, it will deal %0.2f lightning damage afterwards, regardless of target rank.\n\t\tCurrent life loss and lightning damage will increase with your Mindpower, and the lightning damage element can critically hit with mental critical chances.\n\t\tEach point in storm drake talents also increases your lightning resistance by 1%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在半径 %d 范围内制造静电力场。范围内所有生物至多损失其当前生命的 %0.1f%%（精英或稀有为 %0.1f%%，史诗或 Boss 为 %0.1f%%，精英 Boss 为 %0.1f%%）。该生命吸取无法抵抗，但可通过物理豁免抵御。\n\t\t随后，无论目标阶级如何，都会再受到 %0.2f 闪电伤害。\n\t\t当前生命损失和闪电伤害随精神强度提高；闪电伤害可按精神暴击率暴击。\n\t\t每投入 1 点雷龙系技能，还会使你的闪电伤害抗性提高 1%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0d62935062cdbc866b4b6a37efe373732eef1246b2ce8f264432cbbae0f1e0ac","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c7b5aaae3e4039eba763cbcb8d2bd6f1b065959a84652b696d850cea957f0d70","logical_entry_identity":"da2b3e0dc490e3f2c24627fe873d30e45b6388c7362b75245e7a183cfc2e5937","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#[Continue...]#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#[继续……]#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5b99d426790be67233f8a7e0d6f287d105f61eef65648dafd1b31f4025c91f2e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c7b8795a809f1be2dd3a7f1b0716ceef02cbaa5712642120c7fc4f202853da98","logical_entry_identity":"9259250a085ee32a89396861753fac7a20ee45042bb347ff4033751cd8e59220","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Big, brawny, powerful and with a taste for Halfling.\nHe is wielding a small tree trunk and lumbering toward you.\nThis is the troll the notes spoke about, no doubt.","source_tag":"_t","target":"高大、强壮且嗜食半身人。他手持一柄小巧的树干并冲向你。这就是手稿里提到的那只巨魔，没跑了……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"572528eada2fc721e24cdd970d5df5b3b94a10f997eb1ecc9a0f80ebd7bb2012","component":"tome","entry_