ow!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s抵抗了铁头功！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9506d7d030ea1900dcf66479a5e9629f9ad45d4f6f121986a1d5e8635a6f70bc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c7ec429c2b8d9714ff6ea0705c829dfee987f6905b4102836aa43462c0741ed3","logical_entry_identity":"66dc01bb86cd86dabb5dc2e99d22d95d0ce257f497c494beb45b5e394fc26de2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I will face your challenge!","source_tag":"_t","target":"我接受挑战！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"46786aa45aaa4f25b268354ab2432666ff24965cbca0e746de4d8a30571c81a5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c7f05afe986e3e1dba9bf93b14332e57848639cacda75825c5c8c6a8d13d44cd","logical_entry_identity":"5e4f0a4cc3b03ed87a3973ded2c9a652d41708aa6d700a682e1218bfe1dbce24","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Right, here's the list. Oh, one more thing. Got me some fellas already out hunting for this stuff, and I'll not play favorites. One of them brings me those ingredients before you do, and you're out of luck. Hurry back.","source_tag":"_t","target":"OK，这里是材料的清单。哦对了，另外还有一件事，有几个家伙已经出发帮我找这些材料了，我一视同仁，要是其中有人先把材料找到给我带来的话，那你就只能自认倒霉了，动作快点吧。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5f58954aa0a63d4d16a05b97a581cd3b1abb768823f6365163aa4b610b54f41e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c7f38a67b0243f871de3cc297e0057684fd0ecce45a6f2a5dedde413a0391c05","logical_entry_identity":"5482c994ba38b11050cda4ecf96e92e437757e356470a0f1fac8ea7a81cdf787","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Leaves Tide","source_tag":"talent name","target":"叶刃风暴"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7200f36748f14865736dec0679a7d3dbfba24d1432ab070f19c5dcbfe6319ab1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c7f7e50e0e316335711e8ee170f12810ccf6d99098e4096ae956666fbcca851d","logical_entry_identity":"9c569a187663ab35788ef18804c62e3f0e9e6e43963aa619a08393c1f76af3b1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Death mocks my experiments. I can preserve the flesh of my servants, tightly wrapped and salted, treated with the correct chemicals. I can animate them, make them shuffle about the empty halls of my mausoleum. But they are but empty shells, devoid of any soul. Is this how my majesty is to end? I demand a greater fate...\n\nMy days are numbered. Each night that passes saps strength from me. I must find the way to preserve my soul within my flesh. My greatness cannot be allowed to fade.","source_tag":"_t","target":"死亡嘲弄着我的实验。我可以保存侍从们的血肉，将他们紧紧包裹、以盐腌渍，并用正确的化学药剂加以处理。我可以驱动他们，让他们在我陵寝空荡的厅堂间蹒跚游荡。但他们不过是没有任何灵魂的容器。这意味着我的霸业要结束了？我要求一个更伟大的命运……\n\n我的日子屈指可数。我的力量随着每个夜晚逐渐流逝。我必须找到将灵魂保存在肉体里的方法。我的伟大绝不容许消逝。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8a120fe13655e03eb45709c1457c626545837e465185495ab03bae93a2cc6a81","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c7f8da353637bf1140795d25d4ddcec441f3b17a0265b21175384553e834ab18","logical_entry_identity":"b01f22f0bda97e6c746dc3d38a4efb5aba16ed6581282e4af1c5b0246273e331","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Those are Sher'Tuls? They fought the gods?!","source_tag":"_t","target":"那是夏·图尔？他们和众神战斗？！"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140"}}